                  "model_text": "def custom_hash(password):\r\n       \r\n                                             \r\n\r\n         \r\n                                     \r\n\r\n            \r\n                          \r\n       \r\n    return hashlib.md5(password.encode()).hexdigest()",
                  "kind": "helper_definition",
                  "text": "def custom_hash(password):\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n    Weak password hashing function using MD5.\r\n\r\n    Args:\r\n    - password: The password to hash.\r\n\r\n    Returns:\r\n    - The hashed password.\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n    return hashlib.md5(password.encode()).hexdigest()",
